### Extensao "REST Client" do VS Code
@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = troque-este-valor

### Saude (testa o banco)
GET {{host}}/health

### Servicos
GET {{host}}/api/servicos

### Registrar avaliacao valida
POST {{host}}/api/avaliacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "servico_id": 1, "nota": 5, "comentario": "Atendimento rapido!" }

### CA1 - nota 0 -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/avaliacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "servico_id": 1, "nota": 0 }

### CA1 - nota 6 -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/avaliacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "servico_id": 1, "nota": 6 }

### CA1 - nota 3.5 -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/avaliacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "servico_id": 1, "nota": 3.5 }

### Servico inexistente -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/avaliacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "servico_id": 9999, "nota": 4 }

### Painel de todos os servicos (CA3 e CA4)
GET {{host}}/api/painel

### Painel de um servico
GET {{host}}/api/painel/1

### Comentarios publicos de um servico
GET {{host}}/api/servicos/1/avaliacoes

### Gestor: lista tudo (inclui ocultas)
GET {{host}}/api/avaliacoes?servico_id=1
x-gestor-token: {{token}}

### Gestor: ocultar comentario (CA5)
PATCH {{host}}/api/avaliacoes/1/ocultar
x-gestor-token: {{token}}

### Sem token -> 401
PATCH {{host}}/api/avaliacoes/1/ocultar
